    {
      "text": "Combine olive oil, soy sauce, rice vinegar, water, honey, garlic, and ginger in a 1-pint glass jar. Cover the jar with a tight-fitting lid; shake well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gBJeeGL7hhoKaPuOMpVhrKmi-XA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/49923_AsianGingerDressing_ddmfs_step2_4x3_1689-650314eb695b406f92b66612803e3bb4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/49923/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the lid, then heat the jar in the microwave until honey is dissolved, about 1 minute. Allow to cool.",
